node_modules/
# chromium-pack.tar is generated by scripts/make-chromium-pack.js (postinstall) at build time —
# it's deliberately NOT gitignored, even though it's a build artifact and never meant to be
# committed by hand: confirmed in a real deploy that Vercel's zero-config static-file copying
# appears to honor .gitignore when assembling deployable output, so gitignoring it here caused
# the file to be generated during the build but silently excluded from what actually ships,
# leaving /chromium-pack.tar 404ing live even though the build log showed it being created.
